verdict.failing_test_idea:
Two tests at the person's boundary.

UI: apps/ui/test/project.test.tsx. In the fake daemon, a project with 3 done tasks (progress.total 3) gets intake state 'pending' (an Add to plan). Render /projects/:id/summary and expect screen.getAllByText(/Waiting for you: approve the plan/) to have length 1, with one Open link to /inbox. Today it has length 2: data-testid project-status and intake-banner.

Runtime: a composed or real-daemon test. Approve an intake whose first session holds 3 tasks, where tasks 2 and 3 depend on task 1, then start. Read GET /sessions/:id/events with details:
- the size is stated once, or the Plan line's count equals the promise's (no 'Plan: 1 task' beside 'It promised 3 tasks');
- the first-session summary does not say "1 task" when 3 were approved;
- no line reads 'note for the next session' for a note this session consumed.
